---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - JKSPDC Portal" 
  description="Privacy Policy detailing data protection standards, non-tracking commitments, and security measures of JKSPDC."
>
  <div class="space-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Premium Page Header Band -->
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span>Policies</span>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span class="current">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Main Content Area -->
      <main class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Information Collection &amp; Use</h2>
          <p>
            As a general rule, this website does not automatically collect Personal Information about you when you visit the site. You can generally visit the site without revealing Personal Information, unless you choose to provide such information (e.g. submitting feedback, tender queries, or career applications).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Site Visit Data</h2>
          <p>
            This website records your visit and logs the following information for statistical and server management purposes:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-600">
            <li>Your server address / IP address</li>
            <li>The top-level domain name from which you access the Internet (e.g. .gov, .edu, .com, .in)</li>
            <li>The type of browser you use and date/time of access</li>
            <li>The pages accessed and documents downloaded</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic mt-2">
            We do not identify users or their browsing activities, except when a law enforcement agency warrants inspection of server logs.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h2>
          <p>
            A cookie is a piece of software code that an internet web site sends to your browser when you access information at that site. This website uses minimal local storage solely to persist user preferences (such as contrast mode and font sizing) for accessibility purposes. No tracking cookies are used.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Email Management &amp; Security</h2>
          <p>
            Your email address will only be recorded if you choose to send a message or fill out an online form. It will only be used for the purpose for which you have provided it and will not be disclosed without your consent.
          </p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Policy Navigation</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
            <li><a href="/policies/accessibility" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Accessibility Statement</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/terms" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Terms of Use</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/hyperlinking" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Hyperlinking Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/copyright" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Copyright Policy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
